Rationale: The claim states that Brainerd Lakes Regional Airport and the airport connected to Marquette by M-553 are not located in the central business district. The evidence shows that Marquette Sawyer Regional Airport is located in the unincorporated community of K.I. Sawyer, not in the central business district of Marquette. However, there is no reliable information about the location of Brainerd Lakes Regional Airport or the central business district of Brainerd, Minnesota. Since the location of Brainerd Lakes Regional Airport is not established, the claim cannot be fully supported.
